OL,3,GNEWSA'No excuse' for threatening
OL,4,Abehaviour or disruption, says minister
OL,5,Aafter small boats protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolicing minister Sarah Jones says
OL,8,Fthere can be "no excuse" for
OL,9,Fthreatening behaviour or serious
OL,10,Fdisruption after small boats protests
OL,11,Fin Dover and Portsmouth
OL,13,FPeople who "cross the line from
OL,14,Fpeaceful protest into illegality will
OL,15,Fface the full force of the law", she
OL,16,Ftells the Commons
OL,18,FEarlier, police said a small number of
OL,19,Fofficers were injured and some vehicles
OL,20,Fdamaged during unrest in Portsmouth on
OL,21,FSunday
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
